{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":15437376,"ns":0,"title":"Buckling-restrained braced frame","extract":"Buckling-restrained braced frame (BRBF) is a structural steel frame that provides lateral resistance to buckling, particularly during seismic activity.\nThe BRBF is typically a special case of a concentrically braced frame.","description":"Structural steel frame that provides lateral resistance to buckling","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}